{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>韓國女團BLACKPINK成員Lisa向來是潮流風向標，一舉一動都備受全球粉絲關注。今日（30日）她於社交平台大方分享在美國猶他州度假的最新相片，一口氣展現了兩種截然不同的穿搭風格。</p><figure><img alt=\"Lisa荒漠大解放。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148587712245141504643871.jpeg/D5hkVhwKnLfXOAbgwt_fJ1POzGso3OoVV0aFZldGhWY\"/><figcaption>Lisa荒漠大解放。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><p>大露背黑裙側露腰線盡顯美態</p><p>Lisa換上一襲黑色高領露背長裙，站在荒漠岩石前大擺性感甫士。這件長裙的設計極具視覺衝擊，整個大露背剪裁直接延伸至腰際與側臀，更巧妙地用上一條半月形金色金屬裝飾勾勒出火辣的身材曲線，讓其招牌纖腰與後背上的刺青表露無遺，性感指數爆燈。</p><figure><img alt=\"sexy！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148587735847014400296035.jpeg/ImUy8uDEEn8kHkE5Fzma3qaHwlrEGLwJ6JAfu-iQH7s\"/><figcaption>sexy！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬纖腰。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148587733124780032961052.jpeg/K8itUoty8kt4LSlVm0Rg78jCF0-d0LBTCieb-gonm_o\"/><figcaption>大曬纖腰。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好索！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148587730343825408692385.jpeg/tI3mmO-VxmKEZDht4yAywOxRM2hxlGQCYwwzSWMMM0k\"/><figcaption>好索！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"難掩火辣身材。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148587727088914432536408.jpeg/p5yEZPz-e76ySfWI281sZqYHmRkcUaPntvwJ07b8CdM\"/><figcaption>難掩火辣身材。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"sexy！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148587724123410432968235.jpeg/gI2Rck7Xtr2zd81aG4ipH6OTE3ZnhoFhaq6ulmqurpY\"/><figcaption>sexy！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><p>美式復古風造型超Cool</p><p>除了極致性感的晚裝外，Lisa亦大玩美式復古風。她穿上深色牛仔短版背心大曬結實腹肌，下身則搭配黑色長褲並紮入皮靴中，頭戴鴨舌帽，整體造型隨性且帥氣，完美融入當地的自然景致之中，展現出獨特的時尚張力。</p><figure><img alt=\"風格多變。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148588344134209536032687.jpeg/sUkarzFnwnK4QGP0Q1OLOZ30ufLCQfnvnNTE0ZzUxNE\"/><figcaption>風格多變。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好型！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148588341579747328730652.jpeg/t4LlfXa4aZf23p7pad4o9To_xRsVpydb4wwvquMML6o\"/><figcaption>好型！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"腹肌隱約可見。（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148588338773626880127906.jpeg/R6d3MeZ80LoG_WxqltFQoIKO1gFplNJo8B8ssfAfLLE\"/><figcaption>腹肌隱約可見。（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"cool！（IG@lalalalisa_m）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260630/1148588335824900096683271.jpeg/_Cy7mWks7zKjGXMrTlFOJQs2Q2jrv8fvKjPvvioz774\"/><figcaption>cool！（IG@lalalalisa_m）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-30T10:19:40.504835+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":570,"images":10,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}